msgid ""
"## Summary\n"
"\n"
"The §0 tactic will change a goal or hypothesis of\n"
"the form §1 to §2. It will also work on §3\n"
"and on §4.\n"
"\n"
"### Example\n"
"\n"
"If the goal is §5 then §6 will change it to §7.\n"
"\n"
"### Example\n"
"\n"
"If §8 then §9 will change §10 to §11."
