# GPT: “apply” can be explained in different tones; I chose an informal, tutorial-style Russian (“Идея в том…”, “у тебя есть…”) to match the original. I kept the embedded English sentence as-is because it appears verbatim in the source text.
#. §0: `t : P → Q`
#. §1: $P \\implies Q$
#. §2: `h : P`
#. §3: `P`
#. §4: `apply t at h`
#. §5: `h`
#. §6: `Q`
